parameters.text:
=Enrich this B2B lead.

Full Name: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body['Full Name'] }}
Work Email: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body['  Work Email  '] }}
Company Name: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body['  Company Name  '] }}
Phone Number: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body['  Phone Number  '] }}
What are you looking to solve: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body['  What are you looking to solve  '] }}
Date Submitted: {{ $('Webhook').item.json.body['submittedAt'] }}

Email validation:
Status: {{ $json.status }}
Score: {{ $json.score }}
MX records: {{ $json.mx_records }}
SMTP check: {{ $json.smtp_check }}
Disposable: {{ $json.disposable }}
Webmail: {{ $json.webmail }}

Use Search 1 to verify the person and company.

Use Search 2 to verify company size if Search 1 did not provide reliable company-size information.

Return only the required structured fields.

parameters.inputSchema:
{
  "type": "object",
  "properties": {
    "Full Name": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "Work Email": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "Company Name": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "Phone Number": {
      "type": ["string", "null"]
    },
    "What are you looking to solve": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "Lead Score": {
      "type": "string",
      "enum": ["High", "Medium", "Low"]
    },
    "Score Reasoning": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "Enriched Company Size": {
      "type": "string"
    },
    "Date Submitted": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "Full Name",
    "Work Email",
    "Company Name",
    "Phone Number",
    "What are you looking to solve",
    "Lead Score",
    "Score Reasoning",
    "Enriched Company Size",
    "Date Submitted"
  ],
  "additionalProperties": false
}

